{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/tests/fixtures/pi-agent.mjs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:52:59.949593Z","id":"e3918e09d8f007195b1953441a4bc869a6edd4cabd52373f45f9e275a74f8427","body":{"detail":"The driver fakes ExtensionAPI (on, registerTool, registerCommand, sendUserMessage) and emits only session_start, tool_result and session_shutdown; the inject tier's followUp messages are captured only if one arrives before shutdown. Drift between this fake and Pi's real API would go unseen. Kept for now: plan Task 19 replaces it with the real Pi (pi --mode rpc) in RealClients::pi when it un-ignores no_canary_reaches_an_agent_through_pi.","kind":"concern","suggested_fix":"Drive `pi --mode rpc` with the extension when Pi is installed (skip with a reason otherwise), or assert the inject loop delivered at least one message.","summary":"Pi's channel is a hand-written host for the extension, not Pi","tags":["review","task-6","revisit:Task 19 un-ignores no_canary_reaches_an_agent_through_pi","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
